                "text": "Across the country, Americans are starting to see their health care premiums go up.\n\nWhere are House Republicans? Hiding.\nAnd Senate Republicans? They are still refusing to negotiate.\n\nRepublicans can end this shutdown today by simply restoring Americans' health care. https://t.co/IiQQGB3CWH",
