                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Over 24 MILLION people nationwide receive health coverage through the Affordable Care Act, with millions able to afford this health care due to tax credits.\n\nRepublicans want to get rid of these tax credits.\n\nWe won\u2019t let them.",
