                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In 2017, I took to the Senate Floor to defend health care at a time when Republicans wanted to strip millions of their health care coverage.\n\nIt was true then, and 8 years later it's still true now: Republicans work to raise your costs, while Democrats fight to lower them. https://t.co/3BFGdHgZ37",
