                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If Republicans don\u2019t restore the Affordable Care Act tax credits, MILLIONS of people across the country will see their health premiums SKYROCKET.\n\nWant to see how Republicans' attack on health care could impact you? Check your estimated premium costs here: https://t.co/3p1UFXamB4",
