                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Instead of coming to the table to negotiate, Senate Republicans have forced us to vote twelve times on the same CR that would hike health care premiums for MILLIONS.\n\nIt's day 23 of the shutdown. How many more days until @SenateGOP decides to show up for their constituents?",
