                "text": "SNAP & WIC benefits are running out.\n\nACA open enrollment starts in 4 days, & Americans are about to see that Republicans have made their premiums DOUBLE.\n\nAnd instead of addressing any of these issues, Trump wants to extend his trip in Asia...\n\nWhat happened to America first?",
